@baseUrl = https://localhost:7298
@token = REEMPLAZAR_POR_JWT_VALIDO_DE_AUTHENTICATION
@templateId = 1
@templateVersionId = 1
@templateSectionId = 1

### Catálogo: 200. Datos en result; isSuccess y message en todas las respuestas.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/acta-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear plantilla: 201. result.templateId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actaTypeId": 1,
  "name": "Acta general",
  "scope": "GLOBAL",
  "solutionCenterCode": null
}

### Crear versión: 201. result.templateVersionId y result.sections
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Información general",
      "contentType": "FORMULARIO",
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "isRequired": true,
      "configurationJson": {
        "fields": [
          {"key":"fecha","label":"Fecha","type":"date","required":true},
          {"key":"hora","label":"Hora","type":"time","required":true},
          {"key":"lugar","label":"Lugar","type":"text","required":true}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Temas tratados",
      "contentType": "TEXTO",
      "sortOrder": 2,
      "isRequired": false,
      "configurationJson": null
    }
  ]
}

### Consultar sin filtros: 200. result.items, result.page, result.pageSize, result.totalCount, result.totalPages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar por tipo y alcance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates?page=1&pageSize=20&actaTypeId=1&scope=GLOBAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Acta sin reunión. Requiere ACTA_REUNION_CREACION autorizado y R01 asignado al actor.
# Cambiar UUID para una NUEVA operación. Reutilizarlo al reintentar devuelve 409 sin duplicar.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/actas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{
  "templateVersionId": {{templateVersionId}},
  "title": "Seguimiento mensual",
  "documentDate": "2026-12-01",
  "solutionCenterCode": "R01",
  "sections": [
    {"templateSectionId":{{templateSectionId}},"contentJson":{"fecha":"2026-12-01","hora":"10:00","lugar":"Bogotá"}}
  ],
  "participants": [
    {"userName":"Persona de prueba","email":"person@example.invalid","participantType":"EXTERNO","userLogin":null}
  ],
  "meeting": null
}

### Acta presencial. Reserva simulada: integration.state=SIMULADO, ninguna reserva real confirmada.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/actas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

{
  "templateVersionId": {{templateVersionId}},
  "title": "Seguimiento presencial",
  "documentDate": "2026-12-01",
  "solutionCenterCode": "R01",
  "sections": [{"templateSectionId":{{templateSectionId}},"contentJson":{"fecha":"2026-12-01","hora":"10:00","lugar":"Sala principal"}}],
  "participants": [{"userName":"Persona de prueba","email":"person@example.invalid","participantType":"EXTERNO","userLogin":null}],
  "meeting": {
    "modality": "PRESENCIAL",
    "startAt": "2026-12-01T10:00:00-05:00",
    "endAt": "2026-12-01T11:00:00-05:00",
    "timeZone": "America/Bogota",
    "locationDescription": "Sala principal",
    "externalRoomId": "ROOM-1"
  }
}

### Acta virtual. Usar solo con Mode=Simulated; direcciones de ejemplo sin destinatarios reales.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/actas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

{
  "templateVersionId": {{templateVersionId}},
  "title": "Seguimiento virtual",
  "documentDate": "2026-12-01",
  "solutionCenterCode": "R01",
  "sections": [{"templateSectionId":{{templateSectionId}},"contentJson":{"fecha":"2026-12-01","hora":"10:00","lugar":"Microsoft Teams"}}],
  "participants": [{"userName":"Persona de prueba","email":"person@example.invalid","participantType":"EXTERNO","userLogin":null}],
  "meeting": {
    "modality": "VIRTUAL",
    "startAt": "2026-12-01T10:00:00-05:00",
    "endAt": "2026-12-01T11:00:00-05:00",
    "timeZone": "America/Bogota",
    "locationDescription": null,
    "externalRoomId": null
  }
}
